,p_list_template_comment=>'List template for a List region. User Defined Attribute 1 sets the tile size: wide (two columns), tall (two rows) or large (two by two, filled with the primary color); leave it empty for a normal tile, and other values are ignored. Attribute 2 is a short description and Attribute 3 a metric such as ''128'' or ''SAR 4.2M'' (use an application item substitution to keep it live). The grid uses 1 column below 480px of region width (tiles become rows), 2 columns up to 760px, 4 up to 1180px and 6 beyond; tall, wide and large tiles switch their inner layout to show a big metric. While one tile has the pointer the others step back. Everything works with the keyboard in list order, with a visible focus ring. Template options: Tinted tiles, Compact rows, Mono large tile, Hide big icons.'
);
end;
/
