,p_theme_id=>42
,p_css_file_urls=>'#APP_FILES#amc-templates/amc-tpl-flip-tiles.css'
,p_a01_label=>'Description'
,p_a02_label=>'Call to action'
,p_list_template_comment=>'List template for a List region. Front: the entry icon and text. Back: User Defined Attribute 1 as the description and Attribute 2 as the call-to-action text, for example ''Request leave''; when Attribute 2 is empty only an arrow is shown. Tiles turn over on hover and on keyboard focus; each tile is a single link, so Tab moves through the tiles in list order and Enter opens the destination. The current entry has a filled front. On touch screens and under reduced motion both faces are shown together as one tile, so nothing is hover-only and nothing moves. Template options: Flip vertically, Compact, Palette, Ink.'
);
end;
