'  <div class="amc-THoloEdge-body">#BODY##SUB_REGIONS#</div>',
'  <footer class="amc-THoloEdge-footer">#PREVIOUS##CLOSE##NEXT#</footer>',
'  <span class="amc-THoloEdge-foil" aria-hidden="true"></span>',
'</section>'))
,p_page_plug_template_name=>'AMC Holo Edge'
,p_internal_name=>'AMC_TPL_HOLO_EDGE'
,p_javascript_file_urls=>'#APP_FILES#amc-templates/amc-tpl-holo-edge.js'
,p_css_file_urls=>'#APP_FILES#amc-templates/amc-tpl-holo-edge.css'
,p_theme_id=>42
,p_default_label_alignment=>'RIGHT'
,p_default_field_alignment=>'LEFT'
,p_translate_this_template=>'N'
,p_template_comment=>'Region template with a holographic foil edge and header strip. The foil is a repeating gradient of the theme palette colors, softened toward the surface color so the title stays readable; a fine diagonal texture and a glint sit on top. The sheen follows the mouse over the region and drifts slowly otherwise; keyboard focus shifts it as well. The body is a plain surface. Help, Edit, Change, Copy, Delete and Create buttons sit in the header, Previous, Close and Next in the footer. Template options thicken the edge, switch to a brand foil in primary and info tones or a sunset foil in danger and warning tones, stop the drift, or remove the body padding. Without JavaScript the foil still drifts; under reduced motion it stays still. In forced-colors mode the foil is replaced by a system border.'
);
end;
