,p_css_file_urls=>'#APP_FILES#amc-templates/amc-tpl-marquee-links.css'
,p_a01_label=>'Tag'
,p_list_template_comment=>'List template for an announcement or quick-link ticker. The entries scroll sideways in a seamless loop (the JavaScript file repeats the entries with copies that are hidden from screen readers and skipped by the Tab key), reverse direction in right-to-left languages, and pause while the pointer is over the strip, while a link has keyboard focus, or after the pause button is pressed. Use the Tag attribute (A01) for a short label such as New, Due today or Partner shown as a chip before the text. Template options: Slow and Fast change the speed, Reverse scrolls the other way, Band paints a solid primary-color strip, and Plain removes the frame for use inside a page header. Without JavaScript, and under reduced motion, the entries sit still as a wrapped row of links. The pause button label is English text in the After List Entries template; translate it there if needed.'
);
